# Owners of the Feature Machine SDK. The main ruleset needs an owner review for each change.
# The high-risk paths (CONTRIBUTING.md, deep review) are named again, so that a later team can
# own them on their own: the build and review gate, the install and signature checks, the
# permission checks, the shader pins, the workflow that creators copy, and the build settings.
*                                @runshotgun
/tools/fm_pack/                  @runshotgun
/crates/fm_install/              @runshotgun
/crates/fm_feature_sdk/          @runshotgun
/crates/fm_memory/               @runshotgun
/crates/fm_render/shaders/       @runshotgun
/templates/                      @runshotgun
/.github/                        @runshotgun
/.gitattributes                  @runshotgun
/rust-toolchain.toml             @runshotgun
/Cargo.toml                      @runshotgun
/Cargo.lock                      @runshotgun
